<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">3YWN - Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">3 Ywn</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Yowane</para>
  <para style="toc1">AMARUBA GA KASHARHU GA YOWANE</para>
  <para style="h">MARUBA GA KASHARHU GA YOWANE</para>
  <para style="mt1">AMARUBA GA KASHARHU GA YOWANE</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1"/>Nie ono, Kamîra, kuli mwîra wâni Gâyo, nzigira okuli. <verse eid="3JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2"/>Muzigirwa wâni, nkulongîze nti byoshi bikubêre, ozibuhe omu mubiri nk’oku ozibuhire omu murhima.<verse eid="3JN 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yowane akunga Gâyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3"/>Nasîmire bwenêne erhi mbona bene wîrhu bayisha n’erhi nyumva bahamîriza oku osêzire oku by’okuli, oku oshimba okuli omu lugendo lwâwe. <verse eid="3JN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4"/>Ntà kundi kwankansîmîsa kulusha okuyumva oku abâna bâni bashimba okuli. <verse eid="3JN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5"/>Mwîra wâni, kw’okola nka muntu okwânîne okucîkubagirwa omu kujira ebi odwîrhe wajirira bene wîrhu, ciru bakabà bigolo. <verse eid="3JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6"/>Bakungîre obuzigire bwâwe omu ndêko y’abemêzi. Wâjira kwinjà erhi wankabashanira olwîko nk’oku binashingânîne omu masù ga Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="3JN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7"/>Bulya barhenzire emwâbo Izîno lya Nyakasane lirhuma, na ntà kantu abapagani bàbahîre. <verse eid="3JN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8"/>Kuziga rhw’ono rhukwânîne rhuyankirire abantu ba bene abo, lyo rhurhabâlana okukolera okuli.<verse eid="3JN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olugendo lubî lwa Diyotrefi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9"/>Nayandikîre Ekleziya, ci Diyotrefi olonza okubâmwo wa burhanzi arharhuyankirira. <verse eid="3JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10"/>Co cirhumire, erhi nankisha, nanamulongôza oku bijiro byâge n’oku binwa bibî akaz’irhuderhera. Arhanali hoshi aho: arhankaderha mpu ayankirira bene wîrhu, n’abalonza okubayankirira, anakabahanza, abarhenze omu Ekleziya. <verse eid="3JN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11"/>Mwîra wâni, orhashimbaga olwiganyo lubî, ci oshimbe o­lwîganyo lwinjà. Ojira aminjà ali wa Nyamuzinda; naye ojira amabî erhi a­rhabonaga Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="3JN 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olugendo lwinjà lwa Demetriyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12"/>Demetriyo yêhe, boshi kukunga bamukunga, ciru n’Okuli nakwo kunamukunge. Nîrhu rhumuderhîre obuhamîrizi, nâwe wêne omanyire oku obuhamîrizi bwîrhu buli bw’okuli.<verse eid="3JN 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebinwa by’okufundika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13"/>Binji ncigwêrhe nankakubwîzire, ci ntalonzizi okukolêsa obwîno n’akalamu. <verse eid="3JN 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14"/>Nnangâlîre nti rhuli hôfi rhubonane, rhushambâle n’akanwa. <verse eid="3JN 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15"/>Omurhûla kuli we! Abîrhu mpu asinge. Olamuse abîrhu, ngasi muguma omu izîno lyâge.<verse eid="3JN 1:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1"/>
</usx>
